<title>UK: Brazil sets 150 mln stg 10-year bond, 275 bp over.</title>
<headline>Brazil sets 150 mln stg 10-year bond, 275 bp over.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers BZW AND Credit Suisse First Boston.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BRAZIL</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN STG   COUPON     **	  MATURITY    30.JUL.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    30.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+275 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED LATER</p>
<p> MOODY	B1	  LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  BB	  DENOMS (K) 1	   SALE LIMITS US/GB/BR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  BRAZIL    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.75	SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 7.25 PCT GILT DUE DEC.07</p>
<p> NOTES	DEAL HAS A REDENOMINATION-INTO-EUROS CLAUSE.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
